OL,4,G0350FWitness History
OL,5,     GIn 1991, African journalists
OL,6,     Gcreated the Windhoek declaration
OL,7,     G-a set of free press principles.
OL,8,     GIt led to World Press Freedom Day
OL,9,     Gmarked annually on 3 May.
